OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegendary Star Trek and stage actor Sir
OL,8,FPatrick Stewart has died aged 86
OL,10,FTributes have poured in, with Sir Ian
OL,11,FMcKellen describing him as a man "to
OL,12,Fadmire and, in my case, love"
OL,14,FStar Trek co-stars have also praised
OL,15,Fthe actor - William Shatner said
OL,16,FStewart "stood for the best of us"
OL,17,Fwhile George Takei called him an
OL,18,F"irreplaceable legend"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
